sequenceDiagram
    participant Saga as CampaignLifecycleSaga
    participant CampaignRepo as CampaignRepository
    participant Bus as EventBus

    Note over Saga: Campaign lifecycle management (placeholder)

    rect rgb(240, 240, 240)
        note right of Saga: Campaign Activation Step
        Saga->>CampaignRepo: activateCampaign(campaignId)
        CampaignRepo-->>Saga: campaign
    end

    rect rgb(240, 240, 240)
        note right of Saga: Notification Step
        Saga->>Bus: publish(CampaignActivated)
    end

    opt Compensation
        Saga->>CampaignRepo: deactivateCampaign(campaignId)
    end
